  {
    "episode_id": 45973,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45973.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "All right, folks, I'm here today with Senator Lummus. She is calling in from the Senate building right now. She's having a really busy day back-to-back. There's the infrastructure bill on everyone's minds, so we're going to dive right into it. Senator, you recently tweeted in response to the infrastructure bill that, quote unquote, secret bill drafting is more concerning for the future of financial innovation than these, you know, what Elizabeth Warren said, shadowy super coders. How bad is this infrastructure bill really going to be for crypto?",
