        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Decentralized systems differ fundamentally from centralized financial structures.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Overbroad definitions harm innovation in the digital asset sector.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The existing broker definition undermines fair treatment of decentralized actors.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
