        "text": "The speaker believes that large-scale financial legislation often involves strategic intent beyond mere fiscal calculation.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that government agencies like the Treasury Department act with deliberate purpose when drafting major bills.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker considers cryptocurrency regulation or suppression as a plausible motive behind significant financial legislation.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts that public discourse around major economic policy includes credible speculation about underlying motives.",
