  {
    "episode_id": 45973,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45973.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "The treasury, if I read into this correctly, the treasury is the one that put the line about crypto into the bill. And if I also remember correctly, the treasury is the same group that tried to kill crypto wallets several months back. So I'm curious, when you're in the room with these folks, what is the actual level of crypto and Bitcoin knowledge by the folks who really drafted this bill?",
