        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker expects that the individuals involved in drafting the bill possess relevant technical expertise in cryptocurrencies.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a meaningful distinction between policy intentions and actual understanding of technology among policymakers.",
        "confidence": 0.86
