  {
    "episode_id": 45973,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45973.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, it seems to be a really bipartisan issue. It really is the first issue that Senator Wyden and I have had a chance to work on together. But I've worked with other Democrats on this subject to other Republicans. And not all of them are the same people that you would guess would take an interest on this. So when I see anyone within the Senate talk about this, tweet about this, engage on this subject. I really try to develop a relationship with them so we can work on these things together because this is a very nonpartisan or bipartisan whichever way you want to describe it. subject and the fact that we can work on it together on a bipartisan basis I think will give it more street credibility in terms of trying to pass legislation but it's also just better for the digital asset industry.",
