        "text": "The speaker considers 'smartest investors' to be credible sources of economic forecasting.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a meaningful distinction between 'rampant inflation' and 'transitory inflation' in terms of policy and risk assessment.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that differing views on inflation among powerful institutions reflect a genuine disagreement worth highlighting.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The addressee has relevant expertise or responsibility regarding inflation policy.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Inflation expectations matter significantly for actual inflation outcomes.",
