    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/5/45973.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 37,
    "turn_text": "I'll tell you. I have two questions and we can wrap it up here. The, a lot of crypto founders, myself included, who've been at this for a while, I think we are worried, I think the thing that keeps some of us up at night is like the quote unquote big boss, right? Like the big decision that, or really impactful regulatory decision that could happen. And it does feel like there are some regulatory things like this, where we're nervous about it, but it could get so, so, so much worse. And just like gambling 15 years ago, if the government really wants to crack down on something, it can crack down on it. What is the biggest or worst case scenario for the crypto industry, do you think?",
